# Ingest pipeline

| Stage | Job | Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 Load | `RefreshEfemerCz` / `RefreshInstagram*` / `ImportInstagramDump` | `ingest_items` + files → status `loaded` |
| 2 Enrich | `KeywordIngest` (+ inline `KeywordQc`) | keywords, cover/roles, timeframe, tags (`invitation`/`report`) → `keyworded` |
| 3 Public | `MaterializePosts` | `posts` + `post_files` + `layoutJson.parts` → `materialized` |

Taxonomy (`categorized`) is still provisional — soft `kind` ≠ site section. Public model: [`.cursor/rules/content-model.mdc`](content-model.mdc).

**Default target is production** (`curios-vm` / `~/efemer2`) unless the user says local. Local Docker is for code/schema iteration only.

All ops are Katu jobs via `bin/cli.php`. **Interactive long jobs:** `./bin/job` (TTY). **Do not use `-T`** or Ctrl+C leaves orphans — then `./bin/job jobs:kill -f`. On prod:

```bash
gcloud compute ssh curios-vm --zone=europe-west3-c --project=aukce-496911 --account=jablunka@gmail.com \
  --command='cd ~/efemer2 && docker compose -f docker-compose.production.yml exec -T php php bin/cli.php jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.… -f'
```

```bash
cd ~/Sites/efemer

./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Database.Migrate -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ResetImportedContent --args='{"yes":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshEfemerCz -f

./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"efemer_flowers","full":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagram --args='{"account":"himmlhaus","full":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.RefreshInstagramAccounts --args='{"full":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ImportInstagramDump -f

# stage 2 — Gemini keywords / roles / cover / timeframe (KeywordQc inline)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest --args='{"limit":1}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.KeywordIngest --args='{"id":123,"rekeyword":true}' -f
# needs_rekeyword flags are re-queued via KeywordIngest (needsEnrichment)

# eval + corpus (periodic, not per batch)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.EvaluateKeywords -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ExportCorpus -f

# clear LLM results only (keeps stage-1 ingest)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.ResetKeywordEnrichment --args='{"yes":true}' -f

# keyworded → public posts (invitations → udalosti, ephemeral)
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.MaterializePosts -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.MaterializePosts --args='{"id":427}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.MaterializePosts --args='{"invitationsOnly":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.MaterializePosts --args='{"existingOnly":true}' -f
./bin/job jobs:run App.Classes.Jobs.Ingest.MaterializePosts --args='{"kind":"wedding","existingOnly":true}' -f
```

Weddings (`kind=wedding`): KeywordAnalyzer fills `couple` (“Jana a Petr”); MaterializePosts / PostLayoutPlanner set the public **title** to those names and write a short ceremonial **perex** (`posts.excerpt`). Rematerialize with `kind=wedding` after prompt changes.

Uploads go to GCS `gs://efemer/files/{DEV|PROD}/…`. Reset/purge only touches the current env shard. Admin: `/admin/ingest` (pipeline + kind facets + keyword search).

Gemini: Secret Manager `gemini-api-key` (model `gemini-3.8-flash`); local fallback `.secret/gemini.api`. See `gcloud-project.mdc`.

Eval sets: `app/Resources/Ingest/eval/covers.json`, `roles.json`. Exports: `tmp/ingest/exports/` (gitignored, mounted).

| Job | Role |
|---|---|
| `Ingest.RefreshEfemerCz` | efemer.cz → ingest |
| `Ingest.RefreshInstagram` | one IG account → ingest |
| `Ingest.RefreshInstagramAccounts` | both IG accounts → ingest |
| `Ingest.ImportInstagramDump` | `data/instagram` dump → ingest (Archiver or Instaloader) |
| `Ingest.KeywordIngest` | Gemini → `keyworded`; inline KeywordQc; retries `needs_rekeyword` |
| `Ingest.EvaluateKeywords` | score cover/role eval sets |
| `Ingest.ExportCorpus` | CSV/JSON + keyword co-occurrence |
| `Ingest.ResetKeywordEnrichment` | clear LLM fields only (`yes:true`); status → `loaded` |
| `Ingest.MaterializePosts` | → `posts` + selected `post_files` + `layoutJson.parts`; invites ephemeral on `/udalosti`; weddings titled by couple names + perex |
| `Ingest.ResetImportedContent` | wipe posts/ingest/pages + env GCS shard |
| `Database.Migrate` | schema migrations |
| `Pages.ImportEfemerCz` | legacy page-builder import |

Upsert by `(source, sourceKey)`. Diary `postedAt`: body text date first, else index date. Soft kinds: `diary|wedding|gift|portrait|workshop|installation|bouquet|product|other` (no `mourning`). Prefer Instaloader dump when RefreshInstagram is 429 (`instagram.mdc`).
